     "type": "mask_hero",
     "title": "Capturing the essence of our work in words and images",
     "titleh2": "Press Area:<br>\r\nNews from<br>\r\n1,550 Meters<br>\r\n",
     "titleimg": "",
     "text": "<p>Stay informed about all that moves eriro. Experience our visions and projects rooted deep in the Tyrolean Alps, and let yourself be inspired by our stories of the timeless power of mountain nature.</p>\n<p>On request, we are happy to provide more detailed descriptions or additional images. All image rights are held by eriro. If you have any questions about eriro or ideas for collaboration, we are here to assist you.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><i>Willechomen </i>to the eriro press area. Here, you’ll find everything you need to know at a glance:</p>",
     "img": [],
     "sideimg": [],
     "imgsummer": [],
     "sideimgsummer": [],
     "herolayout": "only-text"
    }
   },
